# No emoji

Do not use emoji anywhere in this repo:

- Code, comments, and JSDoc
- Markdown / AGENTS / CLAUDE / Cursor rules
- Logs, console output, and toasts
- UI / i18n copy
- Commit messages and PR text you generate

## Use instead

- Plain text labels
- Short ASCII status words: `OK`, `failed`, `done`

## Examples

```text
Bad:  Deployment successful (with a leading checkmark/party emoji)
Good: Deployment successful

Bad:  Pull latest code (with a leading inbox emoji)
Good: Pull latest code
```

If you edit existing text that contains emoji, remove it in the same change.
